<title>CANADA: TransCanada to manage Ocean State Power.</title>
<headline>TransCanada to manage Ocean State Power.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransCanada PipeLines Ltd said on Wednesday that subsidiary TransCanada Power Corp was awarded a seven-year contract to manage Ocean State Power's 500 megawatt, gas-fired electric generation plant in Burrillville, Rhode Island.</p>
<p>TransCanada owns 40 percent of Ocean State.</p>
</text>
